  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The product of $n$ positive numbers is unity, then their sum is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "chAaU",
      "text": "a positive integer",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4EmQS",
      "text": "divisible by $n$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Jy8iH",
      "text": "equal to $n+\\frac{1}{n}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C5ShX",
      "text": "never less than $n$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, product of $n$ positive number is unity. $\\Rightarrow x_{1} x_{2} x_{3} \\ldots \\ldots x_{n}=1$\r\n\r\nUsing A.M. $\\geq$ GM\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\frac{x_{1}+x_{2}+\\ldots . .+x_{n}}{n} \\geq\\left(x_{1} x_{2} \\ldots \\ldots x_{n}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{n}} \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow x_{1}+x_{n}+\\ldots \\ldots+x_{n} \\geq n(1)^{\\frac{1}{n}}\\left[\\text { From eq }^{\\mathrm{n}}(\\mathrm{i})\\right]\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
